  "notes": "Wi-Fi update Checking now offers Back with transaction-scoped cancellation and the normal animated page return. Completed checks report a matching new firmware or up-to-date result; failed or timed-out network checks report an error instead of check stopped. The UI deadline finishes even when cancellation races a terminal result. Bluetooth resumes after Wi-Fi shutdown using a validated PSRAM framebuffer with mandatory internal DMA staging when the full internal frame cannot be restored. Wi-Fi OFF, AsyncTCP drain, BLE quiescence and cold-start heap safety gates remain required. Adds read-only explicit check transaction and status fields to USB diagnostics. Preserves the 0.1.545b phone flashlight calibration, automatic-light policy and saved trace data. Phone TIRAS Service 0.1.268 remains compatible. Physical Wi-Fi/BLE and Auto acceptance requires user installation and field verification; software checks do not prove hardware acceptance. User installs through Wi-Fi. Charger diagnostic remains paused.",
